      "text_or_visual_description": "The football team has four years. So do we. Not to spend convincing the world that Congo matters. But to spend becoming so deeply rooted in who we are that the world keeps discovering Congo through us. Not through one football team. (Big up the Leopards for real) Through millions of Congolese people. That's the strategy.",
